                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game used to work just fine until they removed the launcher, which then essentially broke the game. After trying all sorts or troubleshooting suggestions I can find online, nothing has helped resolve the game's failure to launch issue which persisted after trying everything. 2k's support services are also not as helpful as they should. Until this game is fixed on steam, it's not recommended to get this game and is most definitely a time and money sink",
